#   libxnvctrl-dev from kfocus or nvidia. These packages are frequently OOD in
#   Ubuntu repos. Use `apt-cache policy` to inspect the results.

# 1st: Utility nvidia packages from kfocus-team-release repo
# Although specified, the `Pin: version` is NOT honored.
